% What lesson 8's route graph should say, weights aside.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/routes.dl --expect programs/routes.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/routes.dl --expect programs/routes.expect

path(a, e).              % by any of three routes
path(b, d).
:- path(e, a).           % a DAG: nothing leads back
:- path(c, b).
:- path(X, X).
